;; The facts are authored HERE and nowhere else. src/association/facts.kotoba
;; (the Clojure reading) and src/association_facts.kotoba (the Kotoba port)
;; are both generated from this file by scripts/gen-kotoba-port.cljk; run it
;; after editing, and `--check` says if either reading has drifted.
;;
;; Every entry carries the page it came from (:source-article) and the
;; verbatim span the claim rests on (:source-quote), in the Portuguese the
;; page is written in. `kbb --backend sci scripts/verify-catalog.cljk --live`
;; fetches each :url and requires that span to still be in it.
;;
;; Two speakers, declared per entry by :url-provenance:
;;   :official-cni-portaldaindustria  CNI's own site -- its institutional
;;                                    pages and its statute (a PDF served
;;                                    from the same site).
;;   :fgv-cpdoc-corroborated          the FGV CPDOC historical dictionary
;;                                    entry on CNI, for the history CNI's
;;                                    own pages do not narrate.
;; Where both speak to the same fact (the 12 August 1938 founding), both
;; are recorded, each under its own id.
;;
;; No personal names of office-holders are persisted here. The compliance
;; page carries a message signed by the current President, the forums page
;; names each thematic council's chair, and the FGV entry names past
;; presidents and industrialists; the spans quoted below stop before every
;; name, and no page is cited for its list of names.
;;
;; Figures CNI gives about itself (27 federations, more than 1,350 unions,
;; more than 70 sectoral association presidents in the FNI) are recorded as
;; what CNI states, not as independently measured facts.

